            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>•  <strong>EDI-purified water</strong> – base solution<br/><br/>• <strong>Glycerin</strong> – adds moisture<br/><br/>• <strong>Citric acid</strong> – balances pH<br/><br/>• <strong>Cetylpyridinium chloride monohydrate</strong> – antibacterial effect<br/><br/>• <strong>Tea polyphenols</strong> – freshens breath<br/><br/>• <strong>Allantoin</strong> – soothing<br/><br/>• <strong>Green tea extract</strong> – natural antibacterial & protective</p><p>✔️ pH-balanced and fragrance-free<br/><br/>✔️ Not tested on animals (cruelty-free)<br/><br/>✔️ Free from alcohol, fluoride, and harsh chemicals</p>",
            "page": "free-e-book-the-secret-to-a-sparkling-home-in-just-15-minutes-a-day",
