            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<ul><li>Slip the wipe over your index finger<br/></li><li>Gently rub along your dog's teeth and gumline<br/></li><li>Focus on areas with visible buildup<br/></li><li>Use daily or 2-3 times a week for best results</li></ul>",
