            "author": "– Sara Johansen"
          }
        },
        "column_7KVQn9": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "I’m very satisfied",
            "text": "<p>I’ve used this product on my dog for a few weeks now, and I’m very satisfied.<br/><br/>His teeth look much cleaner, and his breath has noticeably improved.<br/><br/>It’s also very easy to use, which is a big plus.</p>",
