    "collapsible_content_TbfYVV": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_tR8CwM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this 100% safe for my pet?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>✅ <strong>Yes! The wipes are made to be as gentle as they are effective.</strong></p><p>They are free from:</p><ul><li>❌ Alcohol<br/><br/></li><li>❌ Parabens<br/><br/></li><li>❌ Essential oils (which can irritate some pets)<br/><br/></li><li>❌ Harsh chemicals or artificial fragrances<br/><br/></li></ul><p>Our formula is developed with veterinary insight to ensure safety for both dogs and cats – even those with sensitive gums or skin.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wWEXkL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I use the product?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Slip the wipe over your finger.</p><ol><li>Gently rub along your pet’s teeth and gums in circular motions.<br/><br/></li><li>Focus especially on the gum line and any areas with visible plaque or discoloration.<br/></li></ol><p>No toothbrush. No mess. No stress.</p><p>Use daily or 1–2 times a week for best results.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3fRqLL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this a substitute for toothbrushing?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>For most pet owners: yes.</p><p>Brushing is best – but often unrealistic in everyday life.</p><p><strong>FreshWipes provides a simple and reliable way to care for your pet’s oral health – without the struggle.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4GGYLx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s in the formula?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Only what your pet needs – nothing more. Every ingredient is carefully selected to support safe and effective oral care:</p><ul><li><strong>EDI-purified water</strong> – gentle base solution</li><li><strong>Cetylpyridinium chloride monohydrate</strong> – proven antibacterial used in human oral care</li><li><strong>Allantoin</strong> – soothes and protects sensitive gums</li><li><strong>Glycerin</strong> – moisturizes gums and oral tissue</li><li><strong>Citric acid</strong> – balances pH to prevent bacterial growth</li><li><strong>Tea polyphenols</strong> – freshens breath naturally</li><li><strong>Green tea extract</strong> – natural antibacterial & protective</li></ul><p>✔️ <strong>pH-balanced & alcohol-free</strong> – safe for daily use<br/><br/>✔️ <strong>No fluoride or harsh chemicals</strong><br/><br/>✔️ <strong>Not tested on animals</strong> (cruelty-free development)</p><p><em>Just safe, simple, and effective dental care – in every wipe.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_X6j8jm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When can I expect results?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p><strong>🦷 Fresh breath? In just a few days.</strong><br/><br/>🦷 Cleaner teeth and healthier gums? 2–3 weeks with regular use.</p><p><strong>Hold tight – your pet’s mouth will thank you!</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DDddPH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is FreshWipes suitable for all breeds and sizes?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the wipes are flexible and work well for everything from small toy breeds to large dogs – and for cats.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MXzfid": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do the wipes help with bad breath?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Antibacterial ingredients and natural breath-fresheners help reduce plaque and bad odor.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xUbf8N": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should I store FreshWipes?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Store the container in a cool, dry place. Avoid direct sunlight to maintain moisture in the wipes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_pA7czt": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What happens if I’m not satisfied?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We stand behind our product with a <strong>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong>.</p><p>If you don’t see a visible difference – or if it simply doesn’t work for your pet – just reach out.<br/><br/>You’ll get a <strong>full refund</strong>, no questions asked.</p><p><strong>No stress. No hassle. Just peace of mind.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "collapsible_row_tR8CwM",
